# McKernel Rust Migration Log

Date: 2026-05-11
Workspace: /home/hgordon/projects/mckernel
Primary target: smp-x86 / x86_64

## Operating Rules

- Keep the mixed C/Rust kernel bootable after each merge-sized step.
- Preserve C headers, exported symbol names, syscall numbers, ioctl values,
  packet formats, and linker-visible entry points.
- Introduce Rust behind the existing C ABI first; do not redesign public
  kernel interfaces during the migration.
- Prefer small primitive ports before memory management, scheduler, process,
  or syscall code.
- Record every meaningful adjustment and its justification here.

